      "en": "My words will utter the uprightness of my heart. That which my lips know they will speak sincerely.",
      "ko": "내 말이 내 마음의 정직함을 나타내고 내 입술이 아는바를 진실히 말하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "8098208b12c79cef024b7c2cd26495c254656418fc554afc9c9250f42eed9db6",
      "translation_text_hash": "375066f97fb43b3fe2a528d70f8a48c88c4b3550e12dda6d7b3e1365b581e23c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
