      "en": "If you can, answer me. Set your words in order before me, and stand up.",
      "ko": "네가 할 수 있거든 일어서서 내게 대답하고 내 앞에 진술하라",
      "source_text_hash": "336ca274688ceef0279f3b7c5031244f23e41bbbbae335c58c09d41019913a97",
      "translation_text_hash": "c2eb0d0cb3a5c03d89557173f88be4aa8d0bac2f65c4858124f54994a8c4b2ba",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
