      "en": "Behold, I am toward God even as you are. I am also formed out of the clay.",
      "ko": "나와 네가 하나님 앞에서 일반이니 나도 흙으로 지으심을 입었은즉",
      "source_text_hash": "f31adc3311c48afbea7e5fa327251cddea4870a5004a55d3d16e0c85b0211636",
      "translation_text_hash": "3bbee9c80eb632ff537ace108bcc9214df5bd4dde4119dfb4178e85ad5651c34",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
