      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 33,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "‘I am clean, without disobedience. I am innocent, neither is there iniquity in me.",
      "ko": "나는 깨끗하여 죄가 없고 허물이 없으며 불의도 없거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "208356d0313cee94280614ac16d3ff698f823c13e25b43632a9fe01415607656",
      "translation_text_hash": "8ae42f6790e5f155da7ee3eaf9d6891e2e5dc718818f401d291ec4acd2ae1ecd",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "나는 깨끗하여 죄가 없고 허물이 없으며 불의도 없거늘"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8ae42f6790e5f155da7ee3eaf9d6891e2e5dc718818f401d291ec4acd2ae1ecd"
      ]
